# KEYS: mutt

## Navigation

| Key | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| **j** / **k** | Move down / up |
| **d** / **u** | Move down / up half-page |
| **gg** | Move to top of the list |
| **G** | Move to last message |
| **ctrl-f** | Search mail (indexed with `notmuch`) |
| **l** | Limit view (filter messages) |

---

## Message Operations

| Key | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| **r** | Reply to sender |
| **R** | Reply all |
| **D** | Mark message for deletion |
| **U** | Unmark message for deletion |
| **v** | View / download attachments |
| **S** | Sync and save mailbox changes |
| **ctrl-r** | Mark all messages in folder as read |
| **C** | Copy message to another mailbox |
| **M** | Move message to another mailbox |

---

## URL & Link Handling

* **ctrl-u** / **, ,** - Seek and extract URLs from the message body (usually requires `urlview` or `urlscan`).

---

## Sidebar & Folder Navigation

### Sidebar Controls
* **B** - Toggle sidebar visibility (Hide/Reveal)
* **ctrl-j** / **ctrl-k** - Move highlight down / up in sidebar
* **ctrl-o** - Open the mailbox selected in the sidebar

### Quick Folder Jumps
* **gi** - Go to **Inbox**
* **gs** - Go to **Sent** mail
* **gd** - Go to **Drafts**
* **gS** - Go to **Spam**
* **i#** - Switch to account number **#** (e.g., `i1`, `i2`)

---

## External Syncing

* **o** - Run **Quick Sync** with `offlineimap`
* **O** - Run **Full Sync** with `offlineimap`

